title square screen: Cassette: SAVE on the trim page opens the save box (board CassetteSave): what is written, the files, SAVE AS NEW FILES, REPLACE ORIGINAL, CANCEL
sizes 720x720
ppmm 800
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_PAGE trim
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
tap "SAVE"
wait 400
expect text "SAVE AS NEW FILES"
expect text "REPLACE ORIGINAL"
expect text "CANCEL"
expect text "take_006_20261108-1105-1.wav"
expect text "Keep 02:58.7 to 10:28.7, cut at 2 splits: 3 files."
shot save
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
tap "CANCEL"
wait 300
expect notext "SAVE AS NEW FILES"
say CANCEL closed the box (save_choose cancel)
expect noquit
